# The reduced loopback: run_loopback.sh --subset reduced runs these tests and
# the seedRepro checks. It is the pre-commit run on the simulator that did not
# run the full loopback, so it is chosen to meet each vendor's handling of
# every part of the library at least once:
#  - every agent package in each role it has: Mode A, Mode B source or master,
#    Mode B destination or slave, passive, monitor protocol checks and a Mode B
#    mismatch;
#  - at least one test of every *_lb_tests.svh file;
#  - every report call site of the library that prints in the full loopback,
#    and every branch of an a2c_select_str() or a2c_lane_name() call that the
#    full loopback takes.
# A test that is the only one to print a library message, or a new agent role,
# belongs here. Each layer's loopback directory holds its own reduced.tests.

